(5776997, 840872, 5364, '<td valign="top">But where are Tiny Clanger and the Soup Dragon hiding?</td>', 'But where are Tiny Clanger and the Soup Dragon hiding?', '2009-12-22 07:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777001, 840304, 7010, '<td valign="top">I haven''t got a clue what this is! I guess some sort of artsy object with pieces of fabric? Anyway, I like the structure, color and shadows very much. My favorite of the challenge!</td>', 'I haven''t got a clue what this is! I guess some sort of artsy object with pieces of fabric? Anyway, I like the structure, color and shadows very much. My favorite of the challenge!', '2009-12-22 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777005, 840016, 7010, '<td valign="top">Pfiew, I have a hard time to guess which objects are presented in this challenge. This is no different.Ok wild guess: the inside of a... err no, the outside of a... pfff I give up ;-)<br/>Anyway, very nice abstract you created here. Gave it a 9 and one of my favorites of the challenge!</td>', 'Pfiew, I have a hard time to guess which objects are presented in this challenge. This is no different.Ok wild guess: the inside of a... err no, the outside of a... pfff I give up ;-)Anyway, very nice abstract you created here. Gave it a 9 and one of my favorites of the challenge!', '2009-12-22 08:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777013, 840900, 7010, '<td valign="top">Ehm... potpourri closeup?<br/>I''m gonna stop guessing before some other silly ideas come up;-)<br/>Very nice, dramatic abstract. The image that keeps appearing to me when I look at it, is that of a piëta.  I wonder why you called it angst. To me it brings up drama, but also some kind of tranquillity and peace... not exactly fear (probably with the pieta association). Oh well, imo an image deserves respect (and a good score) when it forces you to look longer as usual and when it sticks to you. You succeeded! Wellseen and beautifully done! 9</td>', 'Ehm... potpourri closeup?I''m gonna stop guessing before some other silly ideas come up;-)Very nice, dramatic abstract. The image that keeps appearing to me when I look at it, is that of a piëta.  I wonder why you called it angst. To me it brings up drama, but also some kind of tranquillity and peace... not exactly fear (probably with the pieta association). Oh well, imo an image deserves respect (and a good score) when it forces you to look longer as usual and when it sticks to you. You succeeded! Wellseen and beautifully done! 9', '2009-12-22 08:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777014, 840767, 7010, '<td valign="top">I especially like the composition and balance of this image. I''m not sure though what it is. Did you experiment with different kinds of fluids? Oil and water maybe? Welldone</td>', 'I especially like the composition and balance of this image. I''m not sure though what it is. Did you experiment with different kinds of fluids? Oil and water maybe? Welldone', '2009-12-22 08:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777015, 840736, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice take on an attractive object. Although I don''t know what exactly makes it attractive to me. I also haven''t got a slightest clue what it is. I''m guessing the handle of a kitchen tool like a spatula or something?</td>', 'Nice take on an attractive object. Although I don''t know what exactly makes it attractive to me. I also haven''t got a slightest clue what it is. I''m guessing the handle of a kitchen tool like a spatula or something?', '2009-12-22 08:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5777022, 840786, 7010, '<td valign="top">A piece of an old lock? Fishing gear?? Ok, enough with the silly guesses...<br/>Nice image, although I would have liked to see everything in focus in this particular macro. Especially the handle, because that''s one of the points the viewers eye is led to.</td>', 'A piece of an old lock? Fishing gear?? Ok, enough with the silly guesses...Nice image, although I would have liked to see everything in focus in this particular macro. Especially the handle, because that''s one of the points the viewers eye is led to.', '2009-12-22 08:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
