(5777371, 840900, 108544, '<td valign="top">Dying plant matter? I am seeing a figure in this image. Did you see it? The top lightest area being the head. To the left is the shoulder shrugged up high. Down low is the arm from that shoulder. The other arm is being brought up to his or her face. Funny what people can see, I wonder if you see it too!<br/>Great image! Love the tones and thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Dying plant matter? I am seeing a figure in this image. Did you see it? The top lightest area being the head. To the left is the shoulder shrugged up high. Down low is the arm from that shoulder. The other arm is being brought up to his or her face. Funny what people can see, I wonder if you see it too!Great image! Love the tones and thanks for sharing!', '2009-12-22 11:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
