(5779860, 840817, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen colored pin heads that look like the solid objects. If so, the blurred reflection effect fading into blue is clever and effective.</td>', 'I''ve seen colored pin heads that look like the solid objects. If so, the blurred reflection effect fading into blue is clever and effective.', '2009-12-23 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
