(5779870, 840742, 81362, '<td valign="top">Mushroom for sure, so expect lower votes from those who seek a more difficult puzzle. The color cast makes it look like tungsten light without white balance correction, which is too bad because the textue is captured well. To my eye, the blank background detracts from the image compared to similar shots where the gills fill the frame (maybe partly correctable with a square crop).</td>', 'Mushroom for sure, so expect lower votes from those who seek a more difficult puzzle. The color cast makes it look like tungsten light without white balance correction, which is too bad because the textue is captured well. To my eye, the blank background detracts from the image compared to similar shots where the gills fill the frame (maybe partly correctable with a square crop).', '2009-12-24 00:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779871, 840834, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like venetian blinds refracted by a glass object.</td>', 'Looks like venetian blinds refracted by a glass object.', '2009-12-24 00:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779874, 840665, 81362, '<td valign="top">Smooth dark shine lends a high tech feel to the image, enhanced by the diagonal composition. Should score well.</td>', 'Smooth dark shine lends a high tech feel to the image, enhanced by the diagonal composition. Should score well.', '2009-12-24 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5779877, 840663, 81362, '<td valign="top">Ah, the younger kids might never have seen a cassette tape up close with the semi-clear fabric leader against the pressure pad. Great capture of the texture and technology. Hope my guess is close.</td>', 'Ah, the younger kids might never have seen a cassette tape up close with the semi-clear fabric leader against the pressure pad. Great capture of the texture and technology. Hope my guess is close.', '2009-12-24 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
