(5780068, 840547, 37529, '<td valign="top">Interesting Picture.  Looks like outer space.  Maybe a mixture of olive oil and water perhaps?  One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting Picture.  Looks like outer space.  Maybe a mixture of olive oil and water perhaps?  One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2009-12-24 06:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780069, 840814, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great colors and focus is perfect on the center.  Is this a glass bowl with a water drop?  Nicely done whatever it is.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great colors and focus is perfect on the center.  Is this a glass bowl with a water drop?  Nicely done whatever it is.', '2009-12-24 06:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780070, 840834, 37529, '<td valign="top">Lots of elements come together on this excellent shot.  The diagonel orientation of the foreground against the angeled background works well especially with the light and dark shadows.  The B&amp;W is a good choice as well as the borders.  Nicely done, one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Lots of elements come together on this excellent shot.  The diagonel orientation of the foreground against the angeled background works well especially with the light and dark shadows.  The B&W is a good choice as well as the borders.  Nicely done, one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2009-12-24 06:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780073, 840887, 37529, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile.  Maybe a dogs nose but certainly a nose of some critter.  Excellent focus and lighting.  How did you get the animal to stay so still for a shot like this?  One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'This one made me smile.  Maybe a dogs nose but certainly a nose of some critter.  Excellent focus and lighting.  How did you get the animal to stay so still for a shot like this?  One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2009-12-24 06:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780075, 840690, 37529, '<td valign="top">A lot of people don''t like Microsoft so I suspect this shot won''t do well.  Good luck.</td>', 'A lot of people don''t like Microsoft so I suspect this shot won''t do well.  Good luck.', '2009-12-24 06:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780092, 840834, 18655, '<td valign="top">A champagne glass and blinds? Nicely done and easy to guess (not 100% sure about the blinds though - nor the glass) but still look ''puzzle like''. Good diagonal. Good choice of b/w -  8</td>', 'A champagne glass and blinds? Nicely done and easy to guess (not 100% sure about the blinds though - nor the glass) but still look ''puzzle like''. Good diagonal. Good choice of b/w -  8', '2009-12-24 08:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780094, 840447, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition. Too noisy for my taste.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition. Too noisy for my taste.', '2009-12-24 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5780095, 840813, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very nice and I''m also stumped - 8<br/> <br/>ETA: I was in the hardware store today to look for a dehumidifier. In the corner of my eye as I was walking up the isle I saw some Nespresso machines and capsules and immediately thought of your image. I looked closer at them, bought a Nespresso machine and ventured home. Now I know more about it. So my guess is: <b>Nespresso capsules</b> - <b>Decaffeinato</b> in the bottom center with an <b>Arpeggio</b> directly above and the wonderful <b>Volluto</b> on the left.</td>', 'Very nice and I''m also stumped - 8 ETA: I was in the hardware store today to look for a dehumidifier. In the corner of my eye as I was walking up the isle I saw some Nespresso machines and capsules and immediately thought of your image. I looked closer at them, bought a Nespresso machine and ventured home. Now I know more about it. So my guess is: Nespresso capsules - Decaffeinato in the bottom center with an Arpeggio directly above and the wonderful Volluto on the left.', '2009-12-24 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
