(5781231, 840840, 108544, '<td valign="top">Nice rule of thirds and focus point. Oh and the nice bohken! It looks recognizable, but I just can''t point my finger on it. Thanks for the frustration! Great image!</td>', 'Nice rule of thirds and focus point. Oh and the nice bohken! It looks recognizable, but I just can''t point my finger on it. Thanks for the frustration! Great image!', '2009-12-25 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5781232, 840766, 108544, '<td valign="top">Its like I''m looking through a plane''s window! Hey honey, take a look at the desert down there!<br/>Love the tones, focal point and waving lines! Now as to what it could be? MMM What jumps to mind, is dirty, windblown snow.<br/>MMM on second inspection, looks like a stucco wall or ceiling? lol Yeah, thanks for the great image! lol</td>', 'Its like I''m looking through a plane''s window! Hey honey, take a look at the desert down there!Love the tones, focal point and waving lines! Now as to what it could be? MMM What jumps to mind, is dirty, windblown snow.MMM on second inspection, looks like a stucco wall or ceiling? lol Yeah, thanks for the great image! lol', '2009-12-25 21:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5781235, 840913, 108544, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a birds nest. It may well be. But the depth of field looks not quite rite. So I''m thinking you shot through a bundle of brush. The main subject being some kind of seeding plant. I''m not sure of the name, but it looks like a feather. Either way on my guess, a fantastic shot! Your use of depth of field is excellent. Tones and exposures bang on. Very well done!</td>', 'At first I thought this was a birds nest. It may well be. But the depth of field looks not quite rite. So I''m thinking you shot through a bundle of brush. The main subject being some kind of seeding plant. I''m not sure of the name, but it looks like a feather. Either way on my guess, a fantastic shot! Your use of depth of field is excellent. Tones and exposures bang on. Very well done!', '2009-12-25 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
